## Overview

A lovely walk around Lake Pfäffikon, ending at the Juckerhof.
There, you can enjoy a little picnic and even pick your own blueberries, for example.

## How to get there

Travel by train to Pfäffikon, ZH.
<JourneyPlanner from="<current location>" to="Pfäffikon ZH, Bahnhof" toFixed time="09:00" target="arrival" />

